			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 761720101,
					"content": "As shiny as Mora, the Golden Loach King of the loachey world!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mikko"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720102,
					"content": "Mora? There's Mora?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720103
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761720103,
					"content": "And did Paimon just hear someone say something about gold...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720104,
					"content": "You sure did! I discovered this uniquely colored Golden Loach while exploring up north. It was the only one in the area with such a distinctive color.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720105,
					"content": "It's thriving now, and I've had a doctor who knows about animals take a look. The color doesn't seem to be caused by anything pathological.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720106,
					"content": "Then why does it look so different?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720107,
					"content": "It could be any number of things. Habitat, environment, the characteristics of the water it lives in, climate... even its diet.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720108,
					"content": "But if you're asking me to pin it down to one specific reason, I'm afraid I just don't know.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720109,
					"content": "And not knowing doesn't bother you?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720110
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761720110,
					"content": "Why would it? It's such a rare phenomenon, I'm incredibly lucky just to have witnessed it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720111,
					"content": "Being able to document my discovery, draw inferences, and make conjectures is more than enough for me!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720112,
					"content": "It's just like a Pink Frostfin Whale...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maisie"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720113,
					"content": "They say if you get the chance to see a Pink Frostfin Whale, your wishes will come true — but they're super, duper rare.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maisie"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720114,
					"content": "Even so, we saw one once, when we were with Linnea. I think it was because she brought us good luck.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maisie"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720115,
					"content": "Wow, we should go look for one too! Paimon has so many wishes... Which one should the whale grant first?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720116,
					"content": "Do different colors really give them mystical powers...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720117
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761720117,
					"content": "...It's probably just wishful thinking.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720118,
					"content": "So pink whales don't have mystical powers!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720119,
					"content": "Well, there are some examples of some creatures with special colors possessing unique abilities... but the Frostfin Whale we saw probably wasn't one of them.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720120,
					"content": "If people were just making wishes, that would be one thing... I'm just worried someone might hurt it because they believe those fanciful stories.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720121,
					"content": "Huh? Would people really do that?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720122,
					"content": "I know this one! Katya told me that some really nasty treasure hunters hunt animals with unusual colors to sell them to collectors.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mikko"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720123,
					"content": "That's right. There was a time when animals from Natlan were highly prized on the black market — live specimens in particular, but bones and furs would also fetch a high price.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720124,
					"content": "Some merchants, looking to sell their smuggled goods at inflated prices, would even go so far as to process and alter them, packaging them as some kind of \"fantasy\" product before selling them to customers.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720125,
					"content": "There was a case I heard where poachers removed the feet from Qucusaurs to make them more aesthetically pleasing and easier to transport...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720126,
					"content": "Collectors who'd never seen a Qucusaurus before actually thought they were naturally legless, spending their entire lives soaring through the sky, living off wind and dew... like some kind of marvel of nature.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720127,
					"content": "Their reckless pursuit of the exotic only fueled the poachers' wickedness — they created a whole smuggling network born from greed and deceit, causing untold harm and suffering...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720128,
					"content": "Ya-ho...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lumi"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720129,
					"content": "In a sea of evil deeds, even a relatively minor act, such as dyeing a creature to change its color, is still wrong.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720130,
					"content": "S—So... should we give that Silver Capybara a bath? Was it also dyed this color by nasty poachers?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720131
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maisie"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720131,
					"content": "I don't think that'll be necessary. When I found it, it was taking a soak in a Hilichurl's cooking pot. Maybe it thought it was a hot spring?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720132
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720132,
					"content": "There can't be that many born with fur like that. That's probably why the smugglers took it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720133
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720133,
					"content": "Paimon can totally imagine what it must have looked like in that cooking pot...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720134
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720134,
					"content": "Right? Despite its unique color, it still has the same nature and temperament as other Capybaras.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720135
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720135,
					"content": "Come to think of it, we caught a White Weasel Thief once before, too.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720136
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mikko"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720136,
					"content": "The Mora thief! What happened to it in the end?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720137
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720137,
					"content": "We let it go. Hopefully it's learned its lesson and won't go near any more Fatui research facilities...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720138
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720138,
					"content": "Unlike our Capybara friend, its change in color must be an acquired trait — perhaps a result of being exposed to such high concentrations of kuuvahki.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720139
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720139,
					"content": "That makes sense...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720140
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720140,
					"content": "When Paimon thinks about it like that, it seems being unique isn't always a good thing.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720141
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720141,
					"content": "Just thinking about how some creatures might suffer because they're different, or that the only reason they're different is that something bad happened to make them that way...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720142
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720142,
					"content": "It might sound a little selfish, but if Lumi wasn't such a special little Jack Frost, we might never have become partners to begin with...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720143
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720143,
					"content": "Ya-ho! Ya-hoho!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720144
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lumi"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720144,
					"content": "It doesn't seem to mind.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720145
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761720145,
					"content": "So it's not always a bad thing either?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720146
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mikko"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720146,
					"content": "If being different brought the two of you together, then of course it's a good thing!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720147
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720147,
					"content": "I remember Helka mentioning a saying from Liyue in one of her letters, something about blessings and misfortune...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720148
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mikko"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720148,
					"content": "\"Every misfortune conceals a blessing, and every blessing hides misfortune.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720149
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maisie"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720149,
					"content": "Hehe, that's the one! By the way, Ms. Linnea, you're being awfully quiet. Where's all that teacher energy gone?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720150
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mikko"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720150,
					"content": "I never thought I'd see the day when you'd be calling me out, Mikko...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720151
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720151,
					"content": "W—Well, you were once part of the Conch Gang too, Ms. Linnea! *sigh* Anyway, why don't we just drop all this deep stuff for today, and you can tell us about the Volkodlak!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720152
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mikko"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720152,
					"content": "Are they really that strong? How do they compare to Snegovik and Leshy?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720153
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mikko"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720153,
					"content": "Hmm, there are many fascinating stories about the Volkodlak that I could tell you... but they'll have to wait for next time.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720154
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720154,
					"content": "Ugh, not \"next time\" again... Alright, but you'd better remember!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Mikko"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7617203,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7617201",
							"3"
						],
						"stepId": 7617201,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_FINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Linnea"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 761720301,
					"content": "Sorry for making you sit through that...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720302,
					"content": "Don't be. I learned quite a few things today too.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720303
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761720303,
					"content": "Seriously? That's wonderful...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7617204,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7617201",
							"3"
						],
						"stepId": 7617201,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_FINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Mikko",
					"Maisie"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 761720401,
					"content": "Hey, I just realized something — you all went to see that Frostfin Whale without me!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mikko"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720402,
					"content": "You were the one who overslept!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761720403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maisie"
				},
				{
					"id": 761720403,
					"content": "Huh? I—In that case, make sure to wake me up next time...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Mikko"
				}
			]
		}
	]
}